g rock platform, with layers upon layers of grand palaces arranged along a central axis, featuring gleaming gilded double-eave roofs, smooth white jade terraces and giant carved pillars, vermilion wooden corridors and towering ceremonial arch gates, ornate stone pavilions perched on cliff edges, all built to mountainous proportions, with cloud-shaped stone railings wrapping around the edges of the floating island. A tiny lone crane glides far below the palace complex, utterly dwarfed by the immense scale of the celestial megastructure. Soft golden dawn light spills over the cloud sea, wrapping the jade and gold architecture in a hazy holy glow, thin mist drifts between the palace halls, deep atmospheric perspective, serene and sublime sacred atmosphere, vast empty cloudscapes stretching endlessly to the horizon."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [433.16827392578125, 286.5259704589844], "pos": [7219.2060546875, -220.0172882080078], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [4, 17], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [356.6253356933594, 187.7691650390625], "pos": [7604.25341796875, -696.4281005859375], "widgets_values": ["An ancient teal-green Yinglong forms the larger geography of a vast mountain world. From an ordinary stone terrace within a secluded Chinese temple precinct, the viewer looks across a deep mist-filled ravine toward one immense, distant curve of the dragon’s body passing behind mountain cliffs. The body is so large that its dark green surface initially reads as another mountain wall; only a broad band of weathered scales, sparse dorsal ridges, and the far silhouette of its neck reveal that the landscape is alive.\n\nA cluster of traditional wooden halls, tiled roofs, narrow bridges, and ancient pines occupies one small ledge within the ravine, visibly connected to the terrain rather than arranged as foreground decoration. Far above the temple valley, the root of one enormous folded wing disappears into cloud layers, while the dragon’s head remains distant and partly obscured by the surrounding peaks. Soft daylight enters through broken clouds, creating pale jade light on wet stone, deep blue-green shadow in the ravine, and restrained aged-gold highlights on the temple roofs. Quiet sacred scale, ancient Chinese mythic landscape, cinematic painterly realism."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 2, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 104, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.8.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-6750.530747239115, 1161.632934738432], "scale": 0.8769226950000036}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 20, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "放大", "bounding": [7209.8056640625, 85.95809936523438, 2267.4287109375, 518.7843017578125]}, {"color": "#00bfd0", "font_size": 170, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Krea2巨构+SeedVR2放大", "bounding": [7217.1728515625, -1143.296